":{"fontSize":"0.72rem","color":"#6a8fa8","fontFamily":"'DM Sans', sans-serif"},"children":["May 20, 2026"," · ","3 min read"]}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"'Syne', sans-serif","fontWeight":900,"fontSize":"clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.5rem)","lineHeight":1.15,"letterSpacing":"-0.025em","color":"#e8f4ff","marginBottom":"1rem"},"children":"Why Every Developer Should Learn Networking"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","color":"#3d5a6e","lineHeight":1.7,"fontFamily":"'DM Sans', sans-serif","fontWeight":300},"children":"TCP/IP isn't just for sysadmins. Understanding packets makes you a 10x engineer."}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"height":"1px","background":"linear-gradient(90deg, #34d39940, transparent)","margin":"2rem 0"}}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","style":{"paddingBottom":"5rem"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Most developers treat the network as a black box. You send an API request, and data magically comes back. "}}],["$","div","1",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","2",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"But when a distributed system breaks, the network is often the culprit. Developers who understand networking resolve bugs in minutes that take others days."}}],["$","div","3",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","h2","4",{"children":"It Makes You a Better Debugger"}],["$","div","5",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","6",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"When your frontend cannot reach the backend, do you know how to isolate the issue? "}}],["$","p","7",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"* Is it a DNS resolution failure?"}}],["$","p","8",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"* Is a firewall dropping the packets?"}}],["$","p","9",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"* Is it a CORS preflight failure?"}}],["$","div","10",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","11",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Understanding the OSI model turns mysterious timeouts into diagnosable system errors."}}],["$","div","12",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","h2","13",{"children":"Core Concepts You Must Know"}],["$","div","14",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","15",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong>1. DNS (Domain Name System)</strong>"}}],["$","p","16",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Learn how domains map to IPs. Understand the difference between an A record and a CNAME, and why TTL (Time To Live) dictates how long DNS changes take to propagate."}}],["$","div","17",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","18",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong>2. TCP vs. UDP</strong>"}}],["$","p","19",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"* <strong>TCP:</strong> Guarantees delivery and order. Used for web traffic and APIs. It requires a 3-way handshake."}}],["$","p","20",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"* <strong>UDP:</strong> Fast but unreliable. Packets can drop. Used for gaming and live video streaming."}}],["$","div","21",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","22",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong>3. The TLS Handshake</strong>"}}],["$","p","23",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Understand what happens before an HTTPS connection is secured. Knowing this helps you debug certificate mismatch errors instantly."}}],["$","div","24",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","h2","25",{"children":"Practical Skills: Command Line Debugging"}],["$","div","26",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","27",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"You don't need a heavy GUI tool to debug network calls. The terminal is your best friend. If you run a Linux environment, you already have the tools."}}],["$","div","28",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","29",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong>Check DNS Resolution with Dig:</strong>"}}],["$","p","30",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Find out exactly where a domain is pointing."}}],["$","p","31",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<code></code>`bash"}}],["$","p","32",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"dig +short api.nilckson.tech"}}],["$","p","33",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<code></code>`"}}],["$","div","34",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","35",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong>Trace an API Call with cURL:</strong>"}}],["$","p","36",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Use the verbose flag to see the exact headers, handshake, and response times."}}],["$","p","37",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<code></code>`bash"}}],["$","p","38",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"curl -v -X GET https://api.nilckson.tech/health"}}],["$","p","39",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<code></code>`"}}],["$","div","40",{"style":{"height":"0.5rem"}}],["$","p","41",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Mastering these basics bridges the gap between writing code and deploying resilient, high-performance infrastructure."}}]]}],["$","$L9",null,{}]]}]]}]]
